# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# This matters more here than in most projects: `agent.cordis.yml` is a
# composition the harness parses, and it is copied from this clone into a
# harness home. A checkout that rewrites its line endings would hand the loader
# a different file than the one that was verified.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, should any ever be added.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
